Government schools, NSW and SA: grounds, spending, budgets and outcomes.
Copyright 2026 Craig Muldoon. Made with Plotlay (https://www.getplotlay.com).

This repository contains code, data we made, and data from the sources below. It has three views: NSW on its own,
SA on its own with the same method, definitions and charts, and NSW and SA side by side. SA material appears only
alongside the identical NSW analysis.

